        "original_id": "88f8d119-2326-5703-adc4-17eaaf192655",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Anthony\n- Organizations: New York Mets, Major League Baseball\n- Places: Shea Stadium, Citi Field, Mets–Willets Point\n- Roles: Public Address announcer\n- Topics: New York City Bus Q48\n\nFacts:\n- Alex Anthony has served as the Public Address announcer for Major League Baseball's New York Mets since 2004.\n- Alex Anthony first held the New York Mets Public Address announcer role at Shea Stadium.\n- In 2009, the New York Mets moved to Citi Field.\n- Since the New York Mets moved in 2009, Alex Anthony has continued as the team's Public Address announcer at Citi Field.\n- Citi Field is served by trains at Mets–Willets Point.\n- Citi Field is also served by the New York City Bus Q48 route.",
